    "Exact system basenames by default; tool directories supplied explicitly. Small/fully encrypted files use full writes in this export",
    "Optional locally built C ChaCha8 adapter checks upstream Python/NumPy outputs at startup; only source and build instructions exported",
    "Cross-volume movement, audit/exception handling, zero-copy sharing and data-preserving reinstall exported as methods only; no production service credentials/configuration or deployment",
    "Private handoff records remain outside public Git worktree and history"
